{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fling, fail, and laugh your way to the top in <i>Fling &quot;Friends&quot;</i>\u00a0- a 3D co-op physics platformer where one bad Fling drags everyone down!</strong> You and up to Four friends are tied together by a single Magic rope, climbing a massive Evil Tower full of traps, puzzles, and pure rope-fueled chaos. Every fling can save the team\u2026 or yeet everyone into disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From 2 to 4 players</strong>, climb together or fall together.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/96e9b084be77d5cf467cc2c63ca51acb.poster.avif?t=1759953408\" width=1170 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/96e9b084be77d5cf467cc2c63ca51acb.webm?t=1759953408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/96e9b084be77d5cf467cc2c63ca51acb.mp4?t=1759953408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fling the rope</strong> to save allies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/dad55b7f88127add752b918947ea6014.poster.avif?t=1759953408\" width=1170 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/dad55b7f88127add752b918947ea6014.webm?t=1759953408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986580/extras/dad55b7f88127add752b918947ea6014.mp4?t=1759953408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jump and fling</strong> y